 * Declares the UnitTestSymbol class.
 *
 * UnitTestSymbol represents the semantic symbol associated with a unit test
 * declaration in the AST. It stores the syntactic declaration and the generator
 * produced after semantic validation, allowing the compiler to integrate unit
 * tests into the generated code.
 *
 * <hr>
